  "Persentase posisi dengan return bersih > 0. Sistem trend-following wajar punya win rate": "Percentage of positions with a net return > 0. Trend-following systems normally have a win rate of",
  "banyak rugi kecil, sedikit untung besar. Win rate rendah belum tentu buruk, lihat juga rata-rata dan median": "many small losses, a few big wins. A low win rate is not necessarily bad; also look at the average and median",
  "Rata-rata return bersih per posisi (sudah dipotong biaya ±0,4%)": "Average net return per position (after ±0.4% costs)",
  "Rata-rata return bersih per posisi (sudah dipotong biaya ±0,4%).": "Average net return per position (after ±0.4% costs).",
  "Positif": "Positive",
