  "Return posisi \"yang di tengah\": separuh posisi hasilnya lebih buruk dari angka ini. Jika rata-rata positif tapi median negatif, hasil ditopang": "Return of the \"middle\" position: half of the positions did worse than this. If the average is positive but the median negative, results are propped up by",
  "segelintir trade yang untung besar": "a handful of big winning trades",
  "\"Tanpa 1% trade terbaik\" menguji apakah sistem masih untung tanpa outlier itu": "\"Without the best 1% of trades\" tests whether the system is still profitable without those outliers",
  ". \"Tanpa 1% trade terbaik\" menguji apakah sistem masih untung tanpa outlier itu.": ". \"Without the best 1% of trades\" tests whether the system is still profitable without those outliers.",
