  "Jumlah posisi BUY yang menyentuh TP1/TP2/TP3 atau Stop Loss di hari bursa terakhir (berdasarkan high/low hari itu)": "Number of BUY positions that touched TP1/TP2/TP3 or the Stop Loss on the last trading day (based on that day's high/low)",
  "Jumlah posisi BUY yang menyentuh TP1/TP2/TP3 atau Stop Loss di hari bursa terakhir (berdasarkan high/low hari itu).": "Number of BUY positions that touched TP1/TP2/TP3 or the Stop Loss on the last trading day (based on that day's high/low).",
  "Umur = jumlah hari bursa sejak sinyal. \"Hari ini (baru)\" = sinyal yang muncul di hari bursa terakhir": "Age = number of trading days since the signal. \"Today (new)\" = signals that appeared on the last trading day",
  "Menyembunyikan sinyal dengan penanda ⚠: nilai transaksi rata-rata < Rp 1 M/hari (tidak likuid), jarak Stop Loss > 15%, atau harga < Rp 50": "Hides signals marked ⚠: average traded value < Rp 1 bn/day (illiquid), Stop Loss distance > 15%, or price < Rp 50",
  "Hanya saham anggota indeks yang dipilih. Pilihan ini tersimpan di browser": "Only stocks in the selected index. This choice is saved in the browser",
