  "Harga penutupan pada hari sinyal. Untuk SELL = harga keluar": "Closing price on the signal day. For SELL = exit price",
  "Pivot low terakhir dikurangi 2×ATR (minimal 2×ATR di bawah entry). Persentase = jarak dari entry. Jarak > 15% diberi penanda ⚠": "Latest pivot low minus 2×ATR (at least 2×ATR below entry). Percentage = distance from entry. Distances > 15% are marked ⚠",
  "Target = entry + 1R / 2R / 3R, dengan R = entry − Stop Loss. Persentase = jarak dari entry": "Target = entry + 1R / 2R / 3R, where R = entry − Stop Loss. Percentage = distance from entry",
  "Posisi harga terakhir di antara Stop Loss (kiri) dan TP3 (kanan). Garis tebal = entry, garis tipis = TP1 dan TP2. Zona merah = di bawah entry": "Last price position between the Stop Loss (left) and TP3 (right). Thick line = entry, thin lines = TP1 and TP2. Red zone = below entry",
  "Nilai 0–102 versi SATS (momentum, efisiensi, volume, RSI, struktur, tembusan band). Menurut Track Record": "SATS's 0–102 score (momentum, efficiency, volume, RSI, structure, band breaks). According to the Track Record it is",
