  "Menuju TP1 = posisi berjalan · TP1/TP2 ✓ = level sudah tersentuh · Kena SL / TP3 ✓ selesai = posisi ditutup · Sinyal keluar = sinyal terakhir SELL": "Heading to TP1 = open position · TP1/TP2 ✓ = level touched · Hit SL / TP3 ✓ done = position closed · Exit signal = last signal is SELL",
  "Saham yang sinyal terakhirnya SELL/EXIT, artinya strategi sedang tidak memegang posisi di saham itu": "Stocks whose last signal is SELL/EXIT, meaning the strategy currently holds no position in that stock",
