  "\"SL Reference\" dari script (Follow Line − 0,5×ATR7). Hanya referensi: script tidak menutup posisi di level ini, posisi ditutup oleh sinyal EXIT": "\"SL Reference\" from the script (Follow Line − 0.5×ATR7). Reference only: the script doesn't close positions at this level; positions are closed by the EXIT signal",
  "\"SL Reference\" dari script (Follow Line − 0,5×ATR7). Hanya referensi: script tidak menutup posisi di level ini, posisi ditutup oleh sinyal EXIT.": "\"SL Reference\" from the script (Follow Line − 0.5×ATR7). Reference only: the script doesn't close positions at this level; positions are closed by the EXIT signal.",
  "Stop V10 = Follow Line − 0,5×ATR7, hanya boleh naik. Posisi ditutup jika harga": "V10 stop = Follow Line − 0.5×ATR7, can only move up. The position closes if price",
  "di bawahnya (juga saat tutup di bawah Follow Line dengan filter EMA50/MACD, atau tren berbalik turun)": "below it (also when closing below the Follow Line with the EMA50/MACD filter, or when the trend turns down)",
