  "1/3 dijual di TP1, 1/3 di TP2, 1/3 di TP3 bila tersentuh; sisanya dijual saat keluar, seperti perhitungan Performance di script SATS. Bertahap mengamankan untung saat harga melonjak lalu jatuh lagi, tapi memotong untung dari tren yang terus naik": "1/3 sold at TP1, 1/3 at TP2, 1/3 at TP3 when touched; the rest is sold on exit, like the Performance calculation in the SATS script. Scaling out locks in profit when price spikes and then falls, but cuts profit from trends that keep rising",
  "Hanya saham yang punya pola candle bullish ≤ 2 hari terakhir (mis. hammer, bullish engulfing, morning star) atau pola chart bullish (double bottom, ascending triangle, bull flag). Pola ditampilkan di bawah nama saham; arahkan kursor untuk penjelasan": "Only stocks with a bullish candle pattern in the last ≤ 2 days (e.g. hammer, bullish engulfing, morning star) or a bullish chart pattern (double bottom, ascending triangle, bull flag). Patterns are shown below the stock name; hover for an explanation",
