  "Menghitung jumlah lot supaya rugi saat kena Stop Loss tidak melebihi risiko yang dipilih (modal × risiko %), termasuk fee. Dibatasi juga oleh modal. Catatan: menurut Track Record, posisi lebih sering ditutup oleh sinyal SELL daripada SL": "Calculates the number of lots so that the loss when the Stop Loss is hit does not exceed the chosen risk (capital × risk %), including fees. Also limited by capital. Note: according to the Track Record, positions are closed by SELL signals more often than by the SL",
