  "Cara uji: setiap kali preset/pola MULAI terpenuhi di saham likuid (≥ Rp 1 M/hari, harga ≥ 50), dianggap beli di harga open hari berikutnya lalu dijual setelah 5/10/20/60 hari bursa, dipotong biaya 0,4%. Pilihan \"60 hari + stop\": keluar saat turun 8%, saat tutup di bawah MA50, atau hari ke-60. Sinyal SATS diuji dengan aturan yang sama (bukan TP/SL SATS) supaya bisa dibandingkan. Preset fundamental tidak diuji karena data fundamental masa lalu tidak tersedia (hasilnya akan bias); sinyal SATS sudah diuji di Track Record. Hasil masa lalu tidak menjamin hasil ke depan": "Test method: each time a preset/pattern STARTS to be met in a liquid stock (≥ Rp 1 bn/day, price ≥ 50), it is treated as a buy at the next day's open and a sale after 5/10/20/60 trading days, minus 0.4% costs. The \"60 days + stop\" option: exit on an 8% drop, on a close below MA50, or on day 60. SATS signals are tested with the same rules (not SATS TP/SL) so they can be compared. Fundamental presets are not tested because historical fundamental data is not available (results would be biased); SATS signals are already tested in the Track Record. Past results do not guarantee future results",
