  "Metodologi": "Methodology",
  "Masuk di harga penutupan hari sinyal BUY. Keluar mengikuti aturan tiap strategi. SATS: kejadian pertama antara Stop Loss, TP3, sinyal SELL, atau 100 hari bursa. Turtle: stop 2×ATR atau penutupan di bawah harga terendah 10 hari. UT Bot dan Follow Line: di harga penutupan saat sinyal SELL/EXIT (sesuai script). Riwayat disimpan 3 tahun, hanya untuk saham dengan nilai transaksi ≥ Rp 1 M/hari saat masuk. Jika harga membuka di bawah SL atau di atas TP3 (gap), dianggap keluar di harga pembukaan. Filter nilai transaksi memakai rata-rata 20 hari saat posisi dibuka. Tidak ada ambil untung sebagian di TP1/TP2; kolom \"TP1 tercapai\" hanya mencatat apakah level itu sempat tersentuh. Biaya beli + jual diperkirakan": "Entry at the close of the BUY signal day. Exits follow each strategy's rules. SATS: whichever comes first of Stop Loss, TP3, SELL signal, or 100 trading days. Turtle: 2×ATR stop or a close below the 10-day low. UT Bot and Follow Line: at the close on the SELL/EXIT signal (as in the script). History is kept for 3 years, only for stocks with traded value ≥ Rp 1 bn/day at entry. If price opens below the SL or above TP3 (gap), the exit is assumed at the open. The traded-value filter uses the 20-day average when the position was opened. No partial profit-taking at TP1/TP2; the \"TP1 reached\" column only records whether that level was touched. Buy + sell costs are estimated at",
  "%. Kinerja masa lalu tidak menjamin hasil di masa depan": "%. Past performance does not guarantee future results",
