  "makin kecil makin mudah balik modal; bandingkan dengan sisa hari": "the smaller, the easier to break even; compare it with the days left",
  "“Daya ungkit”: modal yang sama di SW mewakili saham senilai sekian kali lipat. Gearing 10× berarti Rp1 juta di SW ≈ eksposur saham Rp10 juta, sehingga naik-turun nilai SW (dalam %) biasanya jauh lebih besar daripada saham": "“Leverage”: the same capital in an SW represents many times that value in shares. Gearing 10× means Rp1 million in SWs ≈ Rp10 million of stock exposure, so SW value swings (in %) are usually much larger than the stock's",
  "“Daya ungkit”: modal yang sama di SW mewakili saham senilai sekian kali lipat. Gearing 10× berarti Rp1 juta di SW ≈ eksposur saham Rp10 juta, sehingga naik-turun nilai SW (dalam %) biasanya jauh lebih besar daripada saham.": "“Leverage”: the same capital in an SW represents many times that value in shares. Gearing 10× means Rp1 million in SWs ≈ Rp10 million of stock exposure, so SW value swings (in %) are usually much larger than the stock's.",
