  "Selisih harga SW dengan nilai intrinsiknya: “harga harapan” atas sisa waktu. Bagian ini menyusut sampai nol menjelang jatuh tempo (": "Difference between the SW price and its intrinsic value: the “hope value” of the remaining time. This part shrinks to zero toward expiry (",
