  "Untuk edukasi dan materi Product Marketing: waran terstruktur (SW) jenis call, gaya Eropa, diselesaikan tunai saat jatuh tempo. Isi data dari term sheet penerbit. Bukan rekomendasi membeli atau menjual": "For education and Product Marketing material: call-type, European-style structured warrants (SW), cash-settled at expiry. Fill in data from the issuer's term sheet. Not a recommendation to buy or sell",
  "Belum kenal waran terstruktur? Baca ini dulu": "New to structured warrants? Read this first",
