  "call": "call",
  "seperti “bertaruh” harga saham itu akan berada di atas harga tertentu (harga pelaksanaan) saat jatuh tempo, dengan modal jauh lebih kecil daripada membeli sahamnya": "SW is like “betting” that the stock price will be above a certain price (the exercise price) at expiry, with far less capital than buying the shares",
